---
name: alert-dialog
type: registry:ui
title: Alert Dialog
description: A modal dialog for confirmations and other actions that require an explicit response.
dependencies:
  - bits-ui
localRegistryDependencies:
  - button
files:
  - path: index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/index.ts'
  - path: alert-dialog.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/alert-dialog.svelte'
  - path: alert-dialog-trigger.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/alert-dialog-trigger.svelte'
  - path: alert-dialog-portal.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/alert-dialog-portal.svelte'
  - path: alert-dialog-overlay.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/alert-dialog-overlay.svelte'
  - path: alert-dialog-content.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/alert-dialog-content.svelte'
  - path: alert-dialog-header.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/alert-dialog-header.svelte'
  - path: alert-dialog-footer.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/alert-dialog-footer.svelte'
  - path: alert-dialog-title.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/alert-dialog-title.svelte'
  - path: alert-dialog-description.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/alert-dialog-description.svelte'
  - path: alert-dialog-action.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/alert-dialog-action.svelte'
  - path: alert-dialog-cancel.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/alert-dialog-cancel.svelte'
  - path: alert-dialog-media.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/alert-dialog/alert-dialog-media.svelte'
---

Use alert dialog for destructive or high-impact actions that need confirmation before continuing.
Compose with `Trigger`, `Content`, `Header`, `Title`, `Description`, `Footer`, `Cancel`, and `Action`.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import * as AlertDialog from '$lib/components/ui/alert-dialog/index.js';
	import { buttonVariants } from '$lib/components/ui/button.variants.js';
</script>

<AlertDialog.Root>
	<AlertDialog.Trigger class={buttonVariants({ variant: 'outline' })}
		>Show Dialog</AlertDialog.Trigger
	>
	<AlertDialog.Content>
		<AlertDialog.Header>
			<AlertDialog.Title>Are you absolutely sure?</AlertDialog.Title>
			<AlertDialog.Description>
				This action cannot be undone. This will permanently delete your account and remove your data
				from our servers.
			</AlertDialog.Description>
		</AlertDialog.Header>
		<AlertDialog.Footer>
			<AlertDialog.Cancel>Cancel</AlertDialog.Cancel>
			<AlertDialog.Action>Continue</AlertDialog.Action>
		</AlertDialog.Footer>
	</AlertDialog.Content>
</AlertDialog.Root>
```
